==============================================================================
ScopeGuard - Environment Configuration Template
Copy this file to .env and fill in the values for local development.
==============================================================================
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Server
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000

Frontend URL used for CORS

CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MongoDB
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Use a local MongoDB instance or MongoDB Atlas connection string.
Example: mongodb://localhost:27017/scopeguard

MONGODB_URI=

Optional DNS resolver override for MongoDB Atlas.
Set to "true" only if your network's DNS resolver cannot resolve Atlas SRV
records. "false" is recommended otherwise.

MONGODB_OVERRIDE_DNS=false

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Authentication
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Generate a secure random secret for your local .env file.
DO NOT commit the actual secret to Git.

JWT_SECRET=

JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

Legacy/client session secret if required by the existing application.

SESSION_SECRET=

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Google / Gmail OAuth
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fill these in your local .env if Gmail OAuth is enabled by the application.

GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5000/api/gmail/oauth/callback